      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹21.62 (vs ₹16.92 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹21.62 (up from ₹16.92 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹23.3b (up 29% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.77b (up 28% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.6% (down from 7.7% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 32% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 15% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
